   "translation": {
    "en": "and the third division is the one shared between the attached naṣb and the attached jarr — as in «he struck him, them two, them, her, them two, them (f.), you, you two, you (pl.), you (f.), you two, you (f. pl.), me, us», and as in «to him» and so on;",
